#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:2
msgid "Studio Glossary"
msgstr "Studio 术语表"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:4
msgid ""
"These words appear throughout Studio. Knowing the difference makes the UI"
" much easier to read."
msgstr "这些词汇会在 Studio 中反复出现。了解它们之间的区别，可以让界面更容易阅读。"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:7
msgid "Workspace"
msgstr "工作区"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:8
msgid ""
"The project or set of source folders that define the file and tool "
"boundary."
msgstr "定义文件和工具边界的项目或源文件夹集合。"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:11
msgid "Source folder"
msgstr "源文件夹"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:12
msgid ""
"One folder inside a workspace. A multi-root workspace can have several; "
"one can be marked primary."
msgstr "工作区中的一个文件夹。多根工作区可以包含多个源文件夹，其中一个可以标记为主要文件夹。"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:15
msgid "Session"
msgstr "会话"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:16
msgid ""
"A durable conversation with its messages, attachments, plans, run "
"history, and layout preferences."
msgstr "持久化的对话，包含消息、附件、计划、运行历史和布局偏好。"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:19
msgid "Run"
msgstr "运行"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:20
msgid "One execution of a request inside a session."
msgstr "会话中一次请求的执行。"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:22
msgid "Agent"
msgstr "Agent"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:23
msgid ""
"The model-driven process that reads context, chooses tools, and returns "
"answers or changes."
msgstr "由模型驱动的过程，它读取上下文、选择工具，并返回答案或变更。"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:26
msgid "Tool"
msgstr "工具"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:27
msgid ""
"A named operation the agent can request, such as reading a file, running "
"a command, or patching a scene."
msgstr "agent 可以请求的命名操作，例如读取文件、运行命令或修改场景。"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:30
msgid "Approval"
msgstr "审批"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:31
msgid "Your decision to allow or reject a tool, plan, or continuation."
msgstr "你对是否允许或拒绝工具、计划或继续执行所作的决定。"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:33
msgid "Proposal"
msgstr "提案"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:34
msgid ""
"A description of a write before it is applied. Proposals are useful "
"because you can check the target and scope before changing the project."
msgstr "应用写入前对写入内容的描述。提案很有用，因为你可以在修改项目前检查目标和范围。"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:37
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:38
msgid ""
"A check that runs after a change, such as a test, Godot diagnostic, scene"
" run, or terminal command."
msgstr "变更后运行的检查，例如测试、Godot 诊断、场景运行或终端命令。"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:41
msgid "Context"
msgstr "上下文"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:42
msgid ""
"Information sent with a request, including workspace paths, files, "
"folders, images, selected text, review comments, and web elements."
msgstr "随请求发送的信息，包括工作区路径、文件、文件夹、图像、选中文本、审查评论和网页元素。"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:45
msgid "Skill"
msgstr "Skill"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:46
msgid ""
"Reusable instructions that help the agent follow a project or personal "
"workflow. A Skill is not a permission grant."
msgstr "帮助 agent 遵循项目或个人工作流的可复用指令。Skill 不是权限授予。"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:49
msgid "MCP server"
msgstr "MCP server"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:50
msgid ""
"An external tool service that Studio can connect to. Its tools are an "
"additional trust boundary."
msgstr "Studio 可以连接的外部工具服务。它提供的工具构成额外的信任边界。"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:53
msgid "Editor Bridge"
msgstr "Editor Bridge"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:54
msgid ""
"The Godot plugin connection that exposes live editor context and "
"capability-dependent editor operations."
msgstr "Godot 插件连接，提供实时编辑器上下文和取决于能力的编辑器操作。"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:57
msgid "Worktree"
msgstr "Worktree"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:58
msgid ""
"A separate Git checkout used to isolate a session or a permanent line of "
"work from the main checkout."
msgstr "用于将会话或永久工作线与主检出隔离的独立 Git 检出副本。"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:61
msgid "Dock"
msgstr "停靠区"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:62
msgid ""
"A resizable side or bottom panel area that holds tabs such as Changes, "
"Terminal, Files, and Browser."
msgstr "可调整大小的侧边或底部面板区域，用于承载 Changes、Terminal、Files 和 Browser 等标签页。"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:65
msgid "Computer use"
msgstr "Computer use"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:66
msgid ""
"A Windows-only capability that lets the agent observe, and optionally "
"control, one user-selected desktop window for the current turn."
msgstr "仅限 Windows 的能力，允许 agent 在当前轮次观察并（可选地）控制一个用户选定的桌面窗口。"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:69
msgid "External browser"
msgstr "外部浏览器"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:70
msgid ""
"A Chrome or Edge tab outside Studio that the agent can inspect through "
"the Daedalus extension and change only through a separately approved "
"proposal."
msgstr "Studio 外部的 Chrome 或 Edge 标签页。agent 可以通过 Daedalus 扩展检查它，但只能通过单独批准的方案对其进行更改。"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:73
msgid "Trajectory"
msgstr "轨迹"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:74
msgid ""
"The execution-level record for a session, including timing, tool "
"activity, approvals, and diagnostic evidence that is still available."
msgstr "会话的执行级记录，包括耗时、工具活动、审批以及当前仍可用的诊断证据。"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:77
msgid "Goal"
msgstr "Goal"

#: ../../source/reference/glossary.rst:78
msgid ""
"A longer-running objective with cycles, budget, progress, and a "
"completion evaluation."
msgstr "具有周期、预算、进度和完成评估的长期运行目标。"
